       "promptHtml": "כמה תתי-קבוצות <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span> של <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>12</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\{1,2,\\dots,12\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span> מקיימות: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>∩</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∅</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B\\cap\\{1,2,3\\}=\\varnothing</annotation></semantics></math></span> וגם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>12</mn><mo>∈</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">12\\in B</annotation></semantics></math></span>?",
       "explainHtml": "האיברים <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1,2,3</annotation></semantics></math></span> מחוץ ל-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span> והאיבר <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>12</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">12</annotation></semantics></math></span> בפנים: 4 איברים שגורלם נקבע. נשארו <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>12</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">12-4=8</annotation></semantics></math></span> איברים חופשיים, ולכל אחד שתי אפשרויות: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>8</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>256</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^8=256</annotation></semantics></math></span>."
