       "explain": "$16^{15}=4^{30}\\equiv1$ לפי פרמה ($31$ ראשוני ו-$31\\nmid4$). $7^{60}=49^{30}\\equiv1$ כי $31\\nmid49$. לכן הסכום $\\equiv1+1+37=39\\equiv8\\pmod{31}$.",
       "promptHtml": "מהי השארית של <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>16</mn><mn>15</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>7</mn><mn>60</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>37</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">16^{15}+7^{60}+37</annotation></semantics></math></span> בחלוקה ב-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>31</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">31</annotation></semantics></math></span>? (רמז: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>16</mn><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>4</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">16=4^2</annotation></semantics></math></span> ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>7</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>49</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">7^2=49</annotation></semantics></math></span>.)",
       "explainHtml": "<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>16</mn><mn>15</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>4</mn><mn>30</mn></msup><mo>≡</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">16^{15}=4^{30}\\equiv1</annotation></semantics></math></span> לפי פרמה (<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>31</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">31</annotation></semantics></math></span> ראשוני ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>31</mn><mo>∤</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">31\\nmid4</annotation></semantics></math></span>). <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>7</mn><mn>60</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>49</mn><mn>30</mn></msup><mo>≡</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">7^{60}=49^{30}\\equiv1</annotation></semantics></math></span> כי <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>31</mn><mo>∤</mo><mn>49</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">31\\nmid49</annotation></semantics></math></span>. לכן הסכום <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≡</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>37</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>39</mn><mo>≡</mo><mn>8</mn><mspace></mspace><mspace width=\"0.4444em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mspace width=\"0.3333em\"/><mn>31</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\equiv1+1+37=39\\equiv8\\pmod{31}</annotation></semantics></math></span>."
