       "promptHtml": "רוצים להראות ש-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>13</mn><mo>∣</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>36</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">13\\mid3^{36}-1</annotation></semantics></math></span> ולכתוב <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>36</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>k</mi></msup><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>12</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3^{36}=(3^{k})^{12}</annotation></semantics></math></span>. מהו <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span>?",
       "explainHtml": "<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p-1=12</annotation></semantics></math></span>, ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>36</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">36=3\\cdot12</annotation></semantics></math></span>. לכן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>36</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>12</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>27</mn><mn>12</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3^{36}=(3^{3})^{12}=27^{12}</annotation></semantics></math></span>, ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>13</mn><mo>∤</mo><mn>27</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">13\\nmid27</annotation></semantics></math></span>, ולכן פרמה חל."
