       "promptHtml": "כדי להראות ש-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>31</mn><mo>∣</mo><msup><mn>100</mn><mn>150</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">31\\mid100^{150}-1</annotation></semantics></math></span> כותבים <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>100</mn><mn>150</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mn>100</mn><mi>k</mi></msup><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>30</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">100^{150}=(100^{k})^{30}</annotation></semantics></math></span>. מהו <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span>?",
       "explainHtml": "<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>150</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>30</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">150=5\\cdot30</annotation></semantics></math></span>, ולכן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k=5</annotation></semantics></math></span>. ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>31</mn><mo>∤</mo><msup><mn>100</mn><mn>5</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">31\\nmid100^5</annotation></semantics></math></span>, כי <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>31</mn><mo>∤</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">31\\nmid2</annotation></semantics></math></span> ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>31</mn><mo>∤</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">31\\nmid5</annotation></semantics></math></span> (הגורמים הראשוניים של <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>100</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">100</annotation></semantics></math></span>)."
