       "promptHtml": "<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>R</mi><mi>y</mi><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟺</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mn>4</mn><mo>∣</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">xRy\\iff4\\mid(x+3y)</annotation></semantics></math></span>. המחלקה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>7</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[7]</annotation></semantics></math></span> היא <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>:</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>k</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">Z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\{4k+r:\\ k\\in\\mathbb{Z}\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span> עם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0\\le r\\le3</annotation></semantics></math></span>. מהו <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span>?",
       "explainHtml": "היחס שקול ל-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>≡</mo><mi>y</mi><mspace></mspace><mspace width=\"0.4444em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mspace width=\"0.3333em\"/><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x\\equiv y\\pmod4</annotation></semantics></math></span>. <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">7=4\\cdot1+3</annotation></semantics></math></span>, לכן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>7</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[7]=\\{4k+3\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span> ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r=3</annotation></semantics></math></span>."
