      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>R</mi><mi>y</mi><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟺</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mn>4</mn><mo>∣</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">xRy\\iff4\\mid(x+3y)</annotation></semantics></math></span> הוא יחס שקילות על <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">Z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbb{Z}</annotation></semantics></math></span>. האם הוא סדר חלקי?",
